  <dc:creator>Microsoft</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>This package includes the adapter logic to discover and run tests. For access to the testing framework, install the MSTest.TestFramework package.

Supported platforms:
- .NET 4.6.2+
- .NET 8.0+
- .NET 8.0 Windows.18362+ (WinUI)
- UWP 10.0.16299
- UWP 10.0.17763 with .NET 9

MSTest is Microsoft supported Test Framework.</dc:description>
  <dc:identifier>MSTest.TestAdapter</dc:identifier>
